# Optical Disc Applications in Libraries.

**Authors:** Andre, Pamela Q. J.

## Abstract
Discusses a variety of library applications of optical disc storage technology, including CD-ROM, digital videodisc, and WORM. Research and development projects at the Library of Congress, National Library of Medicine, and National Agricultural Library are described, products offered by library networks are reviewed, and activities in academic and public libraries are surveyed. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ399384

